      "title": "My latest cartoon for New Scientist",
      "content_html": "<img src=\"https://64.media.tumblr.com/cba34be46aea52681f0df0fd00aa4a61/ac30b566077d3810-41/s640x960/09ebffb41232eb1037d14c31124777fb01a39b91.jpg\" data-orig-height=\"1000\" data-orig-width=\"1500\" alt=\"1. The entomology department notice board a sign reads &#xE2;&#x80;&#x9C;Employee of the moth: Claire&#xE2;&#x80;&#x9D;&#10;(Claire is spelled with an i)&#10;&#10;2. Clare and a colleague are scientists wearing lab coats, they look at the board. He says &#xE2;&#x80;&#x9C;Congrats, But I think they made a typo.&#xE2;&#x80;&#x9D;&#10;&#10;&#xE2;&#x80;&#x9C;Damn, do they did.&#xE2;&#x80;&#x9D; Says Clare&#10;&#10;3. Clare in the office, seen from outside &#xE2;&#x80;&#x9C;Sorry to bother you boss, but my name is spelled wrong on the poster&#xE2;&#x80;&#x9D;&#10;&#10;4. Her boss is a human-sized moth in a lab coat sitting behind a desk &#xE2;&#x80;&#x9C;Apologies Clare, I&#xE2;&#x80;&#x99;ll get that fixed.&#xE2;&#x80;&#x9D;&#10;(Clare is spelled either no i)&#10;\" srcset=\"https://64.media.tumblr.com/cba34be46aea52681f0df0fd00aa4a61/ac30b566077d3810-41/s75x75_c1/36ec74b8cdeb9ae5a63dc792044b59e94e81fc5d.jpg 75w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/cba34be46aea52681f0df0fd00aa4a61/ac30b566077d3810-41/s100x200/8922bab647dc3561edbf35c7d130326cbd145730.jpg 100w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/cba34be46aea52681f0df0fd00aa4a61/ac30b566077d3810-41/s250x400/cd99a552368554b895d6509b503b90bd64c4e9ba.jpg 250w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/cba34be46aea52681f0df0fd00aa4a61/ac30b566077d3810-41/s400x600/5a42dab1cc9863ca5953ea34e6962c783e4de80b.jpg 400w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/cba34be46aea52681f0df0fd00aa4a61/ac30b566077d3810-41/s500x750/48074b56fbdd73e4ce8d62be74d9da7a02172a61.jpg 500w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/cba34be46aea52681f0df0fd00aa4a61/ac30b566077d3810-41/s540x810/08f8a039d82fd78a6d948b790389dbe5c2b5b298.jpg 540w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/cba34be46aea52681f0df0fd00aa4a61/ac30b566077d3810-41/s640x960/09ebffb41232eb1037d14c31124777fb01a39b91.jpg 640w, htt