      "title": "A summer holidays cartoon for the Guardian",
      "content_html": "<img src=\"https://64.media.tumblr.com/ea8a877907b35d62518810e7d03d423a/196a8eaaa4d94646-10/s640x960/e7a58d464b2851cb6ca53e26ba990619d410b62a.jpg\" data-orig-height=\"887\" data-orig-width=\"1600\" alt=\"Panel 1&#10;Image: a man sits on a sunlonger reading a book&#10;Caption: His body may be lounging contentedly by the pool of a Sicilian villa in the warmth of the afternoon sun...&#10;&#10;Panel 2&#10;Caption 1: But, as on every holiday, the military history dad's mind is far away...&#10;Image: close up of the man who is reading Stalingrad by Anthony Beevor &#10;Caption:  On some blasted steppe, amongst brave, doomed comrades on yet another gruelling campaign. &#10;&#10;Panel 3&#10;Caption: Awestruck by the dreadful power of mechanised warfare, he is lost to all but the most urgent missives. &#10;Image:The sun has sunk a little in the sky. &quot;Would you like another Aperol, darling?&quot; his wife calls from the villa. He replies &quot;Yes please!&quot;\" srcset=\"https://64.media.tumblr.com/ea8a877907b35d62518810e7d03d423a/196a8eaaa4d94646-10/s75x75_c1/697f73b8de5cdbe22de073239af20dc10349b05f.jpg 75w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/ea8a877907b35d62518810e7d03d423a/196a8eaaa4d94646-10/s100x200/e319245540b70a7097557e1479723e05edcf05e1.jpg 100w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/ea8a877907b35d62518810e7d03d423a/196a8eaaa4d94646-10/s250x400/3117b4b8a5a6adc584bb8d420a880bf360f5fce6.jpg 250w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/ea8a877907b35d62518810e7d03d423a/196a8eaaa4d94646-10/s400x600/ae98ecf380b582607addf32beb573665f18dfe95.jpg 400w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/ea8a877907b35d62518810e7d03d423a/196a8eaaa4d94646-10/s500x750/99ec40c1bf7271cca792f4671e43a3829cbc13ef.jpg 500w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/ea8a877907b35d62518810e7d03d423a/196a8eaaa4d94646-10/s540x810/d114eee8c25644ddb90ad18cb7e1860207c4d59c.jpg 540w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/ea8a877907b35d62518810e7d03d423a/196a8eaaa4d94646-10/s640x960/e7a58d464b2851cb6ca53e26ba990619d410b62a.jpg 640w, https://6